, and game list)</i>.\n</p>\n<p class=\"note\">\nThis website is not affiliated with Valve Corporation or Steam.<br>\nYou can delete your account and all of the data at any time.<br>\nWe use cookies to keep your session active.\n</p>\n<form action=\"https://steamcommunity.com/openid/login\" method=\"post\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"openid.identity\" value=\"http://specs.openid.net/auth/2.0/identifier_select\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"openid.claimed_id\" value=\"http://specs.openid.net/auth/2.0/identifier_select\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"openid.ns\" value=\"http://specs.openid.net/auth/2.0\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"openid.mode\" value=\"checkid_setup\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"openid.return_to\" value=\"https://steamdb.info/login/\">\n<button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-steam\" id=\"js-sign-in\">Sign in through <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon octicon-steam\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 0a8 8 0 00-8 7.47c.07.1.13.21.18.32l4.15 1.67a2.2 2.2 0 011.31-.36l1.97-2.8v-.04c0-1.65 1.37-3 3.05-3a3.03 3.03 0 013.05 3 3.03 3.03 0 01-3.12 3l-2.81 1.97c0 .3-.05.6-.17.9a2.25 2.25 0 01-4.23-.37L.4 10.56A8.01 8.01 0 108 0zm2.66 4.27c-1.12 0-2.03.9-2.03 2s.91 1.99 2.03 1.99c1.12 0 2.03-.9 2.03-2s-.9-2-2.03-2zm0 .5c.85 0 1.53.66 1.53 1.49s-.68 1.5-1.53 1.5c-.84 0-1.52-.67-1.52-1.5s.68-1.5 1.52-1.5zM5.57 9.6c-.22 0-.43.04-.62.11l1.02.42c.65.26.95.99.68 1.62-.27.63-1 .93-1.65.67l-1-.4a1.73 1.73 0 003.13-.08c.18-.42.18-.88.01-1.3A1.69 1.69 0 005.57 9.6z\"/></svg> Steam</button>\n</form>\n<p class=\"note muted\">\n<b>How can I verify this is legitimate?</b> When you click the sign in button, you will be redirected to <i>https://steamcommunity.com</i>. If you are already signed into Steam, you can simply click \"Sign In\" without entering your password. SteamDB never receives your username or password.\n</p>\n<script nonce=\"IYU2wYD5/5qPF0qhXIzvcYClM2A=\">\n(function()\n{\ndocument.getElementById( 'js-sign-in' ).addEventListener( 'click', function(e)\n{\nthis.innerHTML = '<span class=\"loader\"></span> Redirecting&hellip;';\nthis.className += \" disabled\";\n} );\n}());\n</script>\n</div>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"footer\" id=\"steamdb-org\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Organization\" itemprop=\"publisher\">\n<meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"SteamDB\">\n<meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"https://steamdb.info/\">\n<meta itemprop=\"logo\" content=\"https://steamdb.info/static/logos/512px.png\">\n<div class=\"footer-container\">\n<nav class=\"footer-menu hide-small\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"navigation-heading\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon octicon-info\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg> About</li>\n<li><a href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/discord/\">Discord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/discord/bot/\">Discord Bot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/faq/\">FAQ &amp; help</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/donate/\">Donate &amp; contribute</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/extension/\">Browser extension</a></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"navigation-heading\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"octicon octicon-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.68 11.74a6 6 0 0 1-7.922-8.982 6 6 0 0 1 8.982 7.922l3.04 3.04a.749.749 0 0 1-.326 1.275.749.749 0 0 1-.734-.215ZM11.5 7a4.499 4.499 0 1 0-8.997 0A4.499 4.499 0 0 0 11.5 7Z\"></path></svg> Discovery</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sales/\">Sales &amp; Deals</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/upcoming/\">Upcoming releases</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/calendar/\">Release calendar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/upcoming/free/\">Free promotions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/bundles/\">Bundles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/pricechanges/\">Price changes</a></li>\n<li>